List all detection codes with brief descriptions

Usage: aur-scan codes [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --category <CATEGORY>
          Filter by category

      --format <FORMAT>
          Output format

          Possible values:
          - text
          - markdown
          - md:       Alias of `markdown`
          - json
          
          [default: text]

  -c, --config <CONFIG>
          Configuration file path

  -s, --severity <SEVERITY>
          Minimum severity to report
          
          [possible values: critical, high, medium, low, info]

  -v, --verbose
          Enable verbose output

  -q, --quiet
          Quiet mode (only show findings)

      --no-color
          Disable colored output (also honored: the NO_COLOR environment variable)

  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')
